The one who dies is left far behind by the living;
how quickly hatred comes—what a wretched addition.
The crop is gathered for the reaper’s harvest;
how many a child lives through the father’s death.

It is possible that it was Jahdam, ʿAmir’s father, who lived into Islam. I called attention to him under the letter jim.
